@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF6EB
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontColor #291B1D
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #BA3143
skinparam activityBackgroundColor white
skinparam activityBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #D8F24B
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #291B1D
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #291B1D
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDF6
skinparam noteBorderColor #BA3143
title Marathon Wrapped — system context
left to right direction
actor Runner
actor "Event organizer" as Organizer
rectangle "Marathon Wrapped\nPrototype system boundary" as System #D8F24B
rectangle "Strava\nExternal service" as Strava
rectangle "Seeded timing and registration data\nSimulated source" as Timing
rectangle "Seeded FotoYu-style photos\nSimulated source" as Photos
Runner --> System : Select runner / BIB\nConnect or disconnect Strava\nRequest image export
System --> Runner : Personal recap and insights\nMatched photos / no-photo state\nExported image or error
Organizer --> System : Create / update demo runners\nRequest event results
System --> Organizer : Event results\nSave confirmation / rejection
System --> Strava : Runner-authorized OAuth\nRequest available metrics
Strava --> System : Authorization outcome\nAvailable metrics / failure
Timing --> System : Sample runners, categories,\nresults and kilometer splits
Photos --> System : Sample photo records\nmatched by BIB
legend bottom
Context diagram: people and data sources outside the application.
Supabase and application modules are internal implementation details.
Instructors evaluate the prototype; they are not runtime actors.
endlegend
@enduml
